{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日行われた10福チェーン\n推しメン決定ドラフト会議で\n私はTSUTAYAさんに\n指名していただきました〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チームTSUTAYAになったのは\nゆったん,ひなちゃん,伊織,私の4人！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんもひなちゃんも\nなかなか私に当たりが強い\nメンバーなので唯一の頼みの綱は\n伊織ですかねヾ(-ω-*)♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはどういう企画かといいますと、\nメンバーが各CDショップさんと\n協力して乃木坂の1stアルバム\n「透明な色」の発売を\n盛り上げちゃお〜♡という企画です♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2015年1月6日にZEPP TOKYOで\n開催される世界一早いアルバム\nお渡し会でチームTSUTAYAが\n10福チェーンの中で1位を\n取れるように頑張りますので\nぜひ透明な色聴いてみたいなぁって\n思ってくれている方がいたら\nTSUTAYAさんでの\n予約待ってます∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、今若月とかずみんと私の\n3人でTSUTAYAさんの\nフリーマガジンVAの表紙を\nさせていただいてます(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"店頭で探してみてねヽ(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゅんっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/22/5140058/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年はひつじさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて、明日は久しぶりの\n握手会だよ〜(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつの間にか手も冷たくなるような\n季節になって来たので来てくれた\nみなさんの手は真夏がぎゅーって\nしてあっためまーす♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はきっとメンバーは\n○○○だらけだろうな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も○○○になるよ(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて来たり、\n何話せばいいんだろう？\nって迷ってる方は\nズッキュンのリクエストや\n自己紹介をしてくれたりとか\nクリスマス誰と過ごしたいかとか\n真夏がかぶれる帽子は果た...\nんんっ！なんでもありません(-ω-*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマス直前の握手デート\nたくさんラブラブしようねヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この頃よく写メ祭りをしてるので\n今日はツーショット祭りを\nしましょ〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/22/5140058/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近私のことが好きらしいちーちゃん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/22/5140058/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同い年かずみん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/22/5140058/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怒りかずみん 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/22/5140058/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"SWITCHの時のりんごさん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/22/5140058/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"TVぴあの時の玲香とワンちゃん♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/22/5140058/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"合間に玲香姫の寝顔(´-ω-｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/22/5140058/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとも言えぬ顔をするななみん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/22/5140058/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人の頭を見て驚く飛鳥(*￢ε￢*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/22/5140058/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んんっ！おぬしも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/22/5140058/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみおな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/22/5140058/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NKDと呼ぶと返事をする中田♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/22/5140058/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいとみさ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラストに〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/22/5140058/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えりか姫の寝顔っ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくちゃんこういうの載せると\n本気で怒って来そうな気が\nするんだけどかわいいから\n許してください(´°ω°｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんおやすみっ♡"}],"source":"archive"}